Scalar is an Android 17 ROM based on LineageOS 24, with light customization on top.

Getting started
---------------

If you are new to building Android, read about the [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop) first.

Initialize the source tree:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/prjkt-scalar/manifest -b 17 --git-lfs
```
Then sync:
```
repo sync
```
Build steps per device are the same as LineageOS, see the [LineageOS Wiki](https://wiki.lineageos.org/).

Contributing
------------

Send pull requests to the relevant repository in [prjkt-scalar](https://github.com/prjkt-scalar).
Changes that belong in LineageOS should go to [LineageOS Gerrit](https://review.lineageos.org/) instead.

